---Sets a new priority to this measure.
---@param Priority number The new priority.
---@return boolean # True in case of success, otherwise false.
function MeasureSetPriority(Priority) end

---Start's a Measure on the ThisObject.
---See MeasureRun for the MeasureToObjects.dbt dispatch gate.
---@param pMeasure Alias AIMeasure (aimeasure)
---@param pThisObject Alias the object that is the this object of the new measure (guildobject)
